# Line endings belong to this repository, not to whoever cloned it.
#
# Without this file the working-tree convention is whatever each machine's
# core.autocrlf happens to be, and this project has three of those at once:
# true on the author's Windows machine, unset in the Linux sandbox the analysis
# is checked in, unset on the CI runner. One generated file then reads clean on
# one of them and as a whole-file diff on another with no value changed
# anywhere, which is eighteen thousand lines of noise for a reviewer to look
# past.
#
# Every writer of a generated file also pins `newline="\n"` where it writes.
# That is the same rule stated per call site; this is the repository-level
# version, so a file produced by hand, by an editor, or by a tool that forgets
# is covered as well. The two are deliberately redundant.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
